      "properties": {
        "snippet": "SWAP Conservation Opportunity Areas for 2025-2035. Conservation Opportunity Areas (COAs) in South Carolina address areas where conservation actions are prioritized to benefit Species of Greatest Conservation Need (SGCN) and their priority habitats. The total percent of the State that is considered any type of COA is slightly under 45%, although the 'core' areas (areas with C1-C4 ranks) are approximately 30% of the State. ",
        "extent": null,
        "commentsEnabled": true,
        "groupDesignations": null,
